message: "If you use Cairn in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Cairn: Persistent Memory for AI Coding Agents"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Tracqi Technology"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TracqiTechnology/cairn"
url: "https://tracqi.com"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.5.5"
date-released: "2026-07-19"
keywords:
  - mcp
  - memory
  - ai-agents
  - semantic-search
  - knowledge-graph
  - claude-code
  - persistent-memory
abstract: >-
  Cairn is a local-first memory system for AI coding agents built on the
  Model Context Protocol (MCP). It provides persistent semantic memory,
  intelligent forgetting, and cross-session learning. Cairn is a
  substantially modified derivative of the OMEGA project, Apache-2.0.
